Alexandra Fasulo runs one of the most prolific anti-solar campaigns online, regularly telling over 2 million followers renewable energy is threatening farms and wildlife.

But how much of her rhetoric is actually true?

@alexhannaford.com spent months parsing through the nuance for HEATED:

